    "Resolve shipper/consignee names to canonical company entities, handling name variants, freight-forwarder-as-filer patterns (where the manifest shows a forwarder, not the actual importer/exporter) and address normalization.",
    "Supplement US ocean-manifest coverage with other countries' available trade-data sources where public (some countries publish aggregate or detailed trade statistics; granular shipment-level access is rare outside the US system).",
    "Build entity-level aggregation (shipment counts, trade-lane volume, commodity mix over time per company) as the analytically useful layer on top of raw per-shipment records.",
    "Cross-reference resolved entities against sanctions and denied-party lists to support supply-chain risk and trade-compliance use cases.",
